<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Nov unemployment rate rises to 2.2 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Nov unemployment rate rises to 2.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's seasonally-adjusted unemployment rate rose to 2.2 percent in November from 1.9 percent a year earlier, provisional figures from the National Statistical Office showed on Friday.</p>
<p>					Nov/96	 Oct/96	 Nov/95</p>
<p>Unemployment (pct) 2.2 1.9 1.9</p>
<p>					  (2.0)	  (1.8)	  (1.8)</p>
<p>NOTE: Unemployment rate in brackets calculated before taking seasonal factors into account.</p>
<p>The ratio of economically active population stood at 62.8 percent in November, up from a year earlier's 62.4 percent.</p>
</text>
